---
import { metaGgaIndicators } from '../../../data/part02/ch09TeachingModels.mjs';

const density = 0.04;
const gradientMagnitude = 0.02;
const base = metaGgaIndicators({ density, gradientMagnitude, kineticEnergyDensity: 0.12 });
---

<figure class="chapter-visual meta-indicator" data-meta-indicator>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：meta-GGA 的 iso-orbital indicators</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: meta-GGA iso-orbital indicators</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>density n</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.01" max="0.12" step="0.005" value="0.04" data-meta-density />
      <output data-meta-density-output>0.040</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>|∇n|</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="0.08" step="0.002" value="0.02" data-meta-gradient />
      <output data-meta-gradient-output>0.020</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>τ relative to τW and τunif</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="3" step="0.05" value="1" data-meta-scale />
      <output data-meta-scale-output>1.00</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="meta-title meta-desc">
    <title id="meta-title">Kinetic-energy-density decomposition into von Weizsacker, uniform-gas, and excess contributions</title>
    <desc id="meta-desc">Bars show tauW, tau uniform, and a chosen kinetic energy density. The derived alpha identifies one-orbital, slowly varying, or weak-bond-like regimes.</desc>
    <line x1="60" y1="240" x2="720" y2="240" class="plot-axis" />
    <rect x="120" y="185" width="110" height="55" class="meta-bar meta-bar--w" data-meta-w-bar />
    <rect x="325" y="140" width="110" height="100" class="meta-bar meta-bar--unif" data-meta-unif-bar />
    <rect x="530" y="105" width="110" height="135" class="meta-bar meta-bar--tau" data-meta-tau-bar />
    <text x="175" y="270" text-anchor="middle">τW</text>
    <text x="380" y="270" text-anchor="middle">τunif</text>
    <text x="585" y="270" text-anchor="middle">τ</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span data-meta-tauw>τW = {base.tauW.toFixed(6)}</span>
    <span data-meta-tauunif>τunif = {base.tauUnif.toFixed(6)}</span>
    <strong data-meta-alpha>α = {base.alpha.toFixed(6)}, z = {base.z.toFixed(6)}</strong>
    <span data-meta-regime>regime: {base.alpha < 0.2 ? 'iso-orbital' : base.alpha < 1.8 ? 'slowly varying / metallic-like' : 'large excess kinetic density'}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>τW = |∇n|²/(8n)，τunif = (3/10)(3π²)²ᐟ³n⁵ᐟ³，α = (τ−τW)/τunif，z = τW/τ。第三个控件选取 τ = τW + c·τunif。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> the controls construct τ = τW + c·τunif and report the standard dimensionless indicators α and z.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>c=0 时 α=0 且 z=1；c=1 时 α=1；τ 不得低于 τW。改变密度和梯度时三项量按声明公式同步更新。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> c=0 gives α=0 and z=1; c=1 gives α=1; τ cannot lie below τW.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>α 与 z 识别局域 orbital environment，不直接给出 exchange–correlation energy、bond order、metallicity 或 functional error。真实 meta-GGA 还需完整 enhancement/interpolation 公式。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the indicators classify a local orbital environment but do not themselves determine an energy, bond order, metallicity, or error.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { metaGgaIndicators } from '../../../data/part02/ch09TeachingModels.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-meta-indicator]').forEach((root) => {
    const densityInput = root.querySelector('[data-meta-density]');
    const gradientInput = root.querySelector('[data-meta-gradient]');
    const scaleInput = root.querySelector('[data-meta-scale]');
    if (!(densityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(gradientInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(scaleInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const setText = (selector, value) => {
      const element = root.querySelector(selector);
      if (element instanceof HTMLOutputElement) element.value = value;
      else if (element instanceof HTMLElement) element.textContent = value;
    };
    const setBar = (selector, value, maximum) => {
      const bar = root.querySelector(selector);
      if (!(bar instanceof SVGRectElement)) return;
      const height = 20 + 160 * Math.min(1, value / Math.max(maximum, 1e-12));
      bar.setAttribute('y', (240 - height).toFixed(2));
      bar.setAttribute('height', height.toFixed(2));
    };

    const update = () => {
      const density = Number(densityInput.value);
      const gradientMagnitude = Number(gradientInput.value);
      const scale = Number(scaleInput.value);
      const preliminary = metaGgaIndicators({ density, gradientMagnitude, kineticEnergyDensity: gradientMagnitude ** 2 / (8 * density) });
      const kineticEnergyDensity = preliminary.tauW + scale * preliminary.tauUnif;
      const result = metaGgaIndicators({ density, gradientMagnitude, kineticEnergyDensity });
      setText('[data-meta-density-output]', density.toFixed(3));
      setText('[data-meta-gradient-output]', gradientMagnitude.toFixed(3));
      setText('[data-meta-scale-output]', scale.toFixed(2));
      setText('[data-meta-tauw]', `τW = ${result.tauW.toFixed(6)}`);
      setText('[data-meta-tauunif]', `τunif = ${result.tauUnif.toFixed(6)}`);
      setText('[data-meta-alpha]', `α = ${result.alpha.toFixed(6)}, z = ${result.z.toFixed(6)}`);
      const regime = result.alpha < 0.2 ? 'iso-orbital' : result.alpha < 1.8 ? 'slowly varying / metallic-like' : 'large excess kinetic density';
      setText('[data-meta-regime]', `regime: ${regime}`);
      const maximum = Math.max(result.tauW, result.tauUnif, result.kineticEnergyDensity);
      setBar('[data-meta-w-bar]', result.tauW, maximum);
      setBar('[data-meta-unif-bar]', result.tauUnif, maximum);
      setBar('[data-meta-tau-bar]', result.kineticEnergyDensity, maximum);
    };

    densityInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    gradientInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    scaleInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .meta-indicator svg { width: 100%; max-height: 22rem; }
  .meta-indicator text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 14px; }
  .meta-bar { opacity: 0.84; }
  .meta-bar--w { fill: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .meta-bar--unif { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .meta-bar--tau { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
</style>
